                            <p></p><h3>Definition of "b3":</h3><p><b>B3</b> is a medium-diaphragm condenser capsule manufactured by BLUE. </p><p>The B3 capsule, according to BLUE, uses a single 18mm diaphragm of 6-micron Mylar on a 22mm backplate. This is a cardioid-only capsule, and is center-terminated.</p><p>The capsule is presented as a &#8220;neutral voice.&#8221; The historical sound reference is the Neumann TLM 170.</p>
